    "État, mémoire, « Décharger », réglages propres et dernières tâches. Qwen3-VL et Qwen3.5 : conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status, memory, “Unload”, its own settings and recent tasks. Qwen3-VL and Qwen3.5: conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
